# commitments it describes live in PRE_REGISTRATION.md, which IS committed.
CLAUDE.md

# Editor config. Machine-specific: it hard-codes an absolute interpreter path,
# so it would be wrong on anyone else's clone.
.vscode/

# OS
.DS_Store
